00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:09.090
like, what's the word I'm looking for?

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:11.480
Notable episodes, like,

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:12.650
so it's not the most memorable

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.140
or the most successful episodes,

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.270
but it's just notable episodes
along the way that said,

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:18.103
yeah,

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:22.500
that's part of the DNA of
"Good Mythical Morning,"

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.650
even if there's stuff
that we don't do anymore.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:25.720
Okay.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.970
And it might jog your
memory in other ways.

