00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:12.110
And it's like, you know,
you're trying to find...

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:13.440
you're trying to find the right zone.

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.320
But you don't speak that...

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:19.470
