00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:24.100
Yeah, that's what it is.
Different circumstances.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:29.100
It's more of like, developing
an on-camera persona

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:30.700
behind that card table.

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:31.533
Right.

